* text=auto eol=lf

*.blade.php diff=html
*.css diff=css
*.html diff=html
*.md diff=markdown
*.php diff=php

/.github export-ignore
CHANGELOG.md export-ignore
.styleci.yml export-ignore

# public/demos holds captured or compiled builds of the *other* projects the
# portfolio links to -- static HTML snapshots, a Flutter web bundle, vendor
# JS. It is output, not source for this repo, but it dwarfs everything else
# by volume, so GitHub reported this as 49% HTML / 47% JavaScript and only
# 1.8% PHP. Marking it vendored keeps it out of the language stats so the
# repo reads as the Laravel app it actually is.
public/demos/** linguist-vendored
